  "comment": [
    "Pack values that are legitimately identical to the English source, so the untranslated-string guard in",
    "tests/unit/locale-pack-manifest.test.js lets them through. \"any\" holds brand names, URLs, file formats and",
    "colour codes that no language translates. Each language list holds its own cognates, loanwords and the",
    "one or two letter tray abbreviations that happen to match. Values with no letters outside {{placeholders}}",
    "need no entry. Add an entry only for a string the language really writes that way, never to hide an",
    "untranslated one: new untranslated strings belong in a translation, not here. An entry whose pack value",
    "is translated later has to be deleted, so the list cannot hide a regression."
